 "_about": "The token tree build_tokens.py turns into tokens.json. A leaf with \"var\" takes its value from that custom property's resolved entry in css-vars.json — the Vite/Tailwind build declares a custom semantic set (--color-primary-label, --color-shading, --super-title-size, the --daw-* production colours) plus Tailwind v4 utilities; with \"theme\": \"dark\" the value is read from the stylesheet's own [data-theme=\"dark\"] override block. A leaf with \"value\" carries a measured value and names the measurement in \"source\" (an anchor of raw/measurements.md, written from raw/components-computed.json). Two themes: light (the marketing site) and dark (the app).",
